{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7d7af0ba-ad5b-8283-bed0-30407821e8a4",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T18:14:05-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carmela Fiore",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:08:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, good evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:08:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Evening. You hear me okay? I got you on speaker."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:08:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you. Little echoey, but go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:08:18-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry. I'm sitting in the cab of a tow truck. Car died on me after work, driver's out back doing paperwork with somebody else, so. That's the way it goes. Figured I'd finally call while I'm stuck here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:08:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's a rough end to a Tuesday. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:08:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's my parents' house. Twenty-five Howard Street, Fifth Ward. The storm drain at the corner backed up again and the basement flooded. Second time this winter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:08:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-five Howard. Okay. Was this from the nor'easter this weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:08:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Overnight Saturday into Sunday. Woke up Sunday, my mother's at the top of the stairs, there's about eight inches down there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:09:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eight inches. Ugh. And where's it coming in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:09:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same spot as last time. The window well on the street side. Water fills the well, comes right through the glass. Every time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:09:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, and you said the second time. When was the first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:09:20-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "December. That soaker before Christmas, the eighteenth, the Thursday. My mother called you guys that weekend. Two inches that time. And a crew came out the Monday after, I'll give you that. They scraped the leaves off the grate and left. That's it. Nobody looked under nothin'."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:09:37-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull it up. [pause] Okay, I see it. Lucille Fiore, December twentieth, corner drain backed up, and a crew cleared the grate on the twenty-second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:09:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's my mother. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:09:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So what did the corner look like Saturday night?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:09:53-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Buried. The catch basin's buried in leaves again, you can't even see the grate. Water's got nowhere to go, so it sits in the street and runs right down into the yard. Right into that window well."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:10:07-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:10:09-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And look, we did our part. I put sandbags at the door Saturday afternoon. Hauled 'em myself. Didn't do a thing. It's not coming in the door. It's coming in the window. And honestly I don't think sandbags fix a drain the city's supposed to be taking care of."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:10:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fair. What got wet down there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:10:31-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same stuff as December. Boxes of the kids' school things, and the spare fridge. Again. Nothing new, just the same stuff getting soaked twice. The boxes are garbage now. Fridge, I don't know. Haven't plugged it in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:10:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry. Is the basement finished at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:10:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. Concrete. Thank God. But my parents are in their seventies, they shouldn't be down there with a shop vac. I was there till midnight Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:10:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'm logging it as a repeat backup at the same location, so it's tied to your mother's report from December."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:11:07-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay but see, that's what I'm saying. [crosstalk] last time, logged, crew comes, rakes the leaves, done. Two months later same thing, worse. Eight inches. I don't want another rake job."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:11:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you cut out. Say that first part again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:11:23-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I said last time it got logged too. And it didn't fix nothin'. So I want somebody who knows drains to look at it. A supervisor, an engineer, whoever. Somebody who's gonna look under the street, not just at the top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:11:38-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll put in a request for a supervisor to call you back, and I'll note that the grate was cleared in December and it flooded anyway. That's a sign there may be something going on in the line itself, and they'll want to know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:11:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Thank you. That's all I'm asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:11:58-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm also putting a crew on the schedule to come out. Earliest I've got is Thursday, the twenty-sixth. Crews are still catching up from the weekend, a lot of corners like yours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:12:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday. [pause] Okay. And they're gonna do more than the leaves?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:12:15-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm writing it in the notes that it's a second flood, that the grate alone didn't solve it, and that they need to check the basin and the line under the corner. That's what goes out with the work order."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:12:30-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:12:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the supervisor callback, you should hear by Friday the twenty-seventh. What number should they use?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:12:39-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Use my cell. Four oh one, five five five, oh one seven four. My mother's got the house phone, but call me, I'll actually pick up. Sorry, she's... yeah, just call me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:12:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one seven four. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:12:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Carmela Fiore. Same last name. C-A-R-M-E-L-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:13:00-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Carmela. So, repeat backup at twenty-five Howard, water through the street-side window well, about eight inches Saturday night into Sunday, leaves on the catch basin at the corner, sandbags at the door didn't help. Crew Thursday, supervisor call by Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:13:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. That's it. [line breaks up] ...what if it rains before Thursday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:13:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Missed the start, but if it rains before Thursday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:13:25-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:13:26-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you see it backing up, call back right away, day or night, this line takes it after hours. And if it's safe, keeping the leaves off the top of that grate helps a little till the crew gets there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:13:41-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I been doing that. Out there with a rake. That's the way it goes, I guess. I just don't wanna be doing this a third time, you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:13:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I know. That's why it's going to a supervisor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:13:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Alright. Driver's coming back, I gotta go. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:14:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good luck with the car, Carmela. Take care."
    }
  ],
